.DS_Store

# Local Netlify CLI state. Netlify no longer serves this site (Cloudflare does — see CLAUDE.md),
# but the site is kept unlinked rather than deleted for a little while so a rollback is one DNS
# record rather than a rebuild. Delete this line and the folder once that window closes.
.netlify

# Local secrets. The VAPID pair lives here so it can be re-read without regenerating —
# regenerating the public key would silently invalidate every push subscription on every device.
.secrets/

# Terraform. State, plans and the plugin cache never belong in git: state holds real resource
# attributes, and a saved plan is a credentialed snapshot of them. There is no .terraform.lock.hcl
# to commit — nothing here runs Terraform outside CI, so the provider is pinned to an exact version
# in main.tf instead; see the comment there.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
tfplan
tfplan.json
